      "title": "Crimea bridge has been attacked again, says Russian-installed governor",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/19/kerch-bridge-crimea-russia-attacked-again-ukraine",
      "description": "<p>Assessment of damage is underway, days after two attacks that destroyed road section of key bridge across Kerch strait linking annexed peninsula to Russia</p><p>A key bridge connecting annexed Crimea to Russia has been attacked again, a Russian-appointed regional governor has said, two days after Ukrainian strikes caused serious damage to it.</p><p>“Following a new attack on the Crimean Bridge, traffic has been temporarily halted. All relevant services are on site and at work. An assessment of the damage is under way,” Sergei Aksyonov, the Kremlin-appointed governor of Crimea, wrote on Telegram.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/19/kerch-bridge-crimea-russia-attacked-again-ukraine\">Continue reading...</a>",
